hub.com/users/breskeby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When using the `elasticsearch.esplugin` plugin and writing test cases which extend from `ESTestCase`, Gradle test execution hangs. While troubleshooting this I recall running into the same issue when initially moving from the Ant test runner to Gradle and it stems from issues with security manager and `BootstrapForTesting`. We have to explicitly grant some permissions to Gradle worker code to please the security manager, if we don't, instead of an error, everything just grinds to a halt. We do this by injecting certain system properties, which are then referenced in the `gradle.policy` security policy. \r\n\r\nTo reproduce simply checkout the `broken-build-7.14` branch of https://github.com/spinscale/elasticsearch-ingest-langdetect and run `./gradlew :test`.\r\n\r\nSimply adding the following system properties (which we add in our `ElasticsearchTestBasePlugin` is enough to get test running.\r\n\r\n```\r\ntest.systemProperties 'gradle.dist.lib': \"${gradle.gradleHomeDir}/lib\",\r\n        'gradle.worker.jar': \"${gradle.gradleUserHomeDir}/caches/${gradle.gradleVersion}/workerMain/gradle-worker.jar\",\r\n        'tests.gradle': 'true',\r\n        'tests.task': test.path\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe may want to move this stuff into a minimal plugin that's applied by `build-tools` as well as `build-tools-internal`.","closed_by":{"login":"breskeby","id":77300,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77300?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby","html_url":"https://github.com/breskeby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breskeby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/76136/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/76136/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}